==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|δενδρίτης||of or pertaining to a tree}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdɛndɹaɪt/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|cytology}} A slender projection of a [[nerve cell]] which conducts [[nerve impulse]]s from a [[synapse]] to the body of the cell; a [[dendron]].
# {{lb|en|cytology}} Slender cell process emanating from the cell bodies of dendritic cells and follicular dendritic cells of the immune system.
# {{lb|en|crystallography|metallurgy}} tree-like structure of crystals growing as material crystallizes
# A [[hermit]] who lived in a [[tree]]

